records.rawDisplayText:
Replace the colors in the snippet with these:
/* Text-color classes */
.hl-red    { color: #e63946; }
.hl-orange { color: #f4a261; }
.hl-yellow { color: #e9c46a; }
.hl-green  { color: #2a9d8f; }
.hl-blue   { color: #457b9d; }
.hl-purple { color: #9b5de5; }

/* Soft background-highlight variants, if you want those too */
.bg-red    { background-color: #e6394633; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0 2px; }
.bg-yellow { background-color: #e9c46a55; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0 2px; }

